    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92628" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοδ-ωνιά</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rose-bed, garden of roses</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hecat.
				37
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				53.16
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>the rose</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.2.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				14.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
